    "Each entry names the upstream repository a grammar and its highlight query were built from.",
    "`refresh-tree-sitter-grammars.mjs` reads this file to regenerate those assets; the generated",
    "output is committed to the repository so builds need no network access or external checkout.",
    "`queries` lists candidate highlight-query paths within the repo, tried in order. Some upstreams",
    "ship no usable query, in which case `queryUrl` points at an external, separately-licensed source",
    "and `queryLicense` records that source's license."
